  'horse-sickness-case-cederberg-movement-ban-2026-10-30',
  'African horse sickness found in Cederberg, horse movements restricted',
  'Community', '2026-10-30', 'South African Government', 'https://www.gov.za/news/media-statements/agriculture-confirms-african-horse-sickness-case-cederberg-imposes-movement',
  'The national Department of Agriculture has confirmed one case of African horse sickness in the Cederberg and stopped horses being moved out of the affected area.',
  'National officials report a positive African horse sickness result in one animal, kept on a Cederberg municipal-area property. The property lies inside the national African horse sickness protection zone, and the virus was identified as serotype 7.

The case was picked up through the national veterinary surveillance system, and a laboratory at the University of Pretoria verified the result. Agriculture Minister Willie Aucamp is listed as the responsible minister in the statement.

An outbreak containment area with movement controls is now in place. Horses may not be moved out of the affected area and no permits are being issued for such movements until further notice. Veterinary Services and partner organisations are carrying out surveillance, tracing and a census of horses in the area.

Owners are asked to report any horse showing fever, swelling of the head or neck, difficulty breathing or sudden death. Officials recommend keeping horses indoors around dusk and dawn, staying clear of damp low ground and applying approved insect repellent. Owners are also told not to vaccinate against the disease during this period, because the live vaccine could be spread by midges.

Anyone planning to travel with horses in or near the Cederberg should follow official updates before making arrangements.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://www.gov.za/news/media-statements/agriculture-confirms-african-horse-sickness-case-cederberg-imposes-movement", "https://www.sanews.gov.za/node/85317", "https://www.capetownetc.com/news/african-horse-sickness-confirmed-in-western-capes-cederberg-region/"]',
  'agent'
